  - point-in-time data
abstract: >-
  A small, honest harness for cross-sectional equity strategy research, with
  look-ahead bias prevented structurally and asserted in tests, an explicit
  transaction-cost and tax model, and a uniform metric suite. Ships with a
  falsifiable indicator inventory for A-share and US equity markets in which
  each indicator carries an availability lag, a three-axis evidence grade, a
  sign hypothesis and an explicit rejection rule. Documentation is licensed
  CC BY 4.0; code is MIT.
